<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Grammy Q2 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Grammy Q2 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     3.46	 vs	     2.88</p>
<p>    Net		    172.78	 vs	   143.98</p>
<p>				   Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     6.30			 5.22</p>
<p>    Net		    314.92			260.98</p>
<p>Notes: Results are audited and consolidated. The company's full name is Grammy Entertainment Plc, a media company.</p>
